{"seq":1,"slug":"life-and-times","title":"玛丽·居里·生平与时代","stage":"DONE","category":"marie-curie","categoryLabel":"玛丽·居里","chapterCount":3,"docCount":6,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/marie-curie/life-and-times","rating":{"composite":3.57,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.4,"coverage":3.25,"positioning":3.67,"strategic":4},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"hubDir":"/Users/wangyang.learnwy/learnwy/learnwy/l-doc-hub/hubs/famous-people/30_marie-curie/1_life-and-times","introHtml":"<h1 id=\"玛丽-居里的生平与时代\">玛丽·居里的生平与时代</h1><p>玛丽·居里（Marie Curie，1867—1934）的一生跨越了三个国家、两个世纪与两门学科。她出生时名为玛丽亚·斯克沃多夫斯卡（Maria Skłodowska），故乡华沙正处在沙皇俄国的高压统治之下，波兰语与波兰历史被逐出课堂。正是在这种被剥夺的环境里，她形成了对知识近乎信仰般的渴求，也埋下了日后远赴巴黎求学的种子。</p>\n<h2 id=\"本卷讲什么-不讲什么\">本卷讲什么、不讲什么</h2><p>本卷（生平与时代）是居里夫人专题的<strong>传记主线</strong>，按时间顺序还原&quot;她这个人&quot;如何在具体处境中做出选择。它与兄弟卷分工如下：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>卷</th>\n<th>侧重</th>\n<th>与本卷的关系</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>1 生平与时代（本卷）</td>\n<td>时间线、人生选择、时代处境</td>\n<td>主线叙事；其余各卷的事实锚点</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../core-contributions/\">2 核心贡献</a></td>\n<td>放射性、钋/镭、原子量、医学应用</td>\n<td>本卷点到为止的科学，在此深挖</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../ideas-and-methods/\">3 思想与方法</a></td>\n<td>测量优先、坚忍、科学公共性</td>\n<td>本卷叙事背后的方法论与价值观</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../major-works/\">4 主要成就</a></td>\n<td>两座诺奖、历史首例、战时建制</td>\n<td>本卷&quot;荣誉&quot;事件的专题展开</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../influence-and-legacy/\">5 影响与遗产</a></td>\n<td>原子时代、女性榜样、机构遗产</td>\n<td>本卷身后事的长程影响</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../controversies-and-appraisal/\">6 争议与评价</a></td>\n<td>朗之万事件、辐射、史学评价</td>\n<td>本卷略提的争议在此平衡审视</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>因此<strong>同一事实只在主篇展开</strong>：本卷凡涉及放射性原理、奖项学术意义、辐射伦理等，均以相对链接指向上述兄弟卷，避免重复。</p>\n<h2 id=\"推荐学习路径与前置\">推荐学习路径与前置</h2><p>无需任何物理化学前置即可阅读本卷；仅 <a href=\"paris-and-discovery/radioactivity-and-the-discovery-of-radium\">放射性研究与镭的发现</a> 中出现一处指数衰变公式，看不懂可跳过结论照样成立。建议顺序：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    A[&quot;1 华沙童年&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;2 飞行大学与家教&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; C[&quot;3 索邦与皮埃尔&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; D[&quot;4 放射性与镭&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; E[&quot;5 两座诺奖与皮埃尔之死&quot;]&#10;    E --&gt; F[&quot;6 一战与最后岁月&quot;]\">flowchart LR\n    A[\"1 华沙童年\"] --&gt; B[\"2 飞行大学与家教\"]\n    B --&gt; C[\"3 索邦与皮埃尔\"]\n    C --&gt; D[\"4 放射性与镭\"]\n    D --&gt; E[\"5 两座诺奖与皮埃尔之死\"]\n    E --&gt; F[\"6 一战与最后岁月\"]</pre><ol>\n<li><a href=\"poland-and-awakening/warsaw-childhood-under-russian-rule\">沙俄统治下的华沙童年</a> — 出身、丧亲、俄化课堂中的隐秘抵抗</li>\n<li><a href=\"poland-and-awakening/flying-university-and-governess-years\">飞行大学与家庭教师岁月</a> — 地下求学、姊妹盟约、出走巴黎</li>\n<li><a href=\"paris-and-discovery/sorbonne-years-and-pierre\">索邦求学与皮埃尔·居里</a> — 阁楼清贫、学业拔尖、科研伴侣的开端</li>\n<li><a href=\"paris-and-discovery/radioactivity-and-the-discovery-of-radium\">放射性研究与镭的发现</a> — 棚屋四年、钋与镭、衰变定律</li>\n<li><a href=\"fame-and-later-years/two-nobel-prizes-and-pierres-death\">两次诺贝尔奖与皮埃尔之死</a> — 荣誉巅峰与丧偶、舆论风暴</li>\n<li><a href=\"fame-and-later-years/world-war-and-final-years\">第一次世界大战与最后岁月</a> — 小居里、镭研究所、辐射的代价</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"为何值得读\">为何值得读</h2><p>居里夫人的传记之所以动人，不仅在于她是史上首位获诺奖的女性、首位两度获奖者、唯一在两个不同科学领域获奖的人，更在于她的成就是在性别壁垒、民族压迫、丧偶之痛与长期辐射侵蚀的多重困境中取得的。理解她的生平，需把个人的坚韧放回那个科学尚未职业化、女性几乎被排除在学术体制之外的时代背景中衡量。</p>\n<p>本卷力求以严谨、平衡的笔触还原一个有血有肉的居里夫人——既不神化，也不回避她生命中的代价与争议，让读者看到天才背后的具体处境、选择与牺牲。</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>主要信源：<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Marie_Curie\">Wikipedia: Marie Curie</a>、<a href=\"https://www.nobelprize.org/prizes/physics/1903/marie-curie/facts/\">Nobel Prize: Marie Curie</a>、<a href=\"https://explore.psl.eu/en/discover/virtual-exhibits/marie-curie-1867-1934\">PSL Explore: Marie Curie 1867–1934</a>。</p>\n</blockquote>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"poland-and-awakening","title":"波兰岁月与科学启蒙","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/marie-curie/life-and-times/poland-and-awakening","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"warsaw-childhood-under-russian-rule","title":"沙俄统治下的华沙童年","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/marie-curie/life-and-times/poland-and-awakening/warsaw-childhood-under-russian-rule"},{"seq":2,"slug":"flying-university-and-governess-years","title":"飞行大学与家庭教师岁月","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/marie-curie/life-and-times/poland-and-awakening/flying-university-and-governess-years"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"paris-and-discovery","title":"巴黎求学与放射性研究","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/marie-curie/life-and-times/paris-and-discovery","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"sorbonne-years-and-pierre","title":"索邦求学与皮埃尔·居里","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/marie-curie/life-and-times/paris-and-discovery/sorbonne-years-and-pierre"},{"seq":2,"slug":"radioactivity-and-the-discovery-of-radium","title":"放射性研究与镭的发现","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/marie-curie/life-and-times/paris-and-discovery/radioactivity-and-the-discovery-of-radium"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"fame-and-later-years","title":"盛名、悲剧与晚年","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/marie-curie/life-and-times/fame-and-later-years","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"two-nobel-prizes-and-pierres-death","title":"两次诺贝尔奖与皮埃尔之死","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/marie-curie/life-and-times/fame-and-later-years/two-nobel-prizes-and-pierres-death"},{"seq":2,"slug":"world-war-and-final-years","title":"第一次世界大战与最后岁月","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/marie-curie/life-and-times/fame-and-later-years/world-war-and-final-years"}]}]}